.SH NDJSON wire format (\f[CR]WIRE_NDJSON\f[R])
Reads bytes until \f[CR]\(rsn\f[R] (newline\-delimited JSON).
The \f[CR]\(dqch\(dq\f[R] field is extracted from the JSON object to
determine the channel.
Flags are always set to 0.
If no \f[CR]\(dqch\(dq\f[R] field is present, defaults to
\f[CR]CHAN_CONTROL\f[R] (0).
